# 大きな文章 (design 11.3, docs/private/fixed-buffer-audit.md 10), for
# tools/ui_run.py: a text of 65536 paragraphs, 12 MB, made as a copy of the
# template 基本文章編集 (mkbig), opened, edited at its end, saved by closing,
# opened again and found as it was saved (sum). The times are printed
# ("time ..."); the limits under them are only what would mean something
# has gone back to laying out the whole text at every turn.
mkbig doc 65536
sum
keep made
mark
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
under open 10000
sync 600
under drawn 10000
shot big_doc_open
# to the end of the text, a letter typed and taken (Enter ends the
# composition), the line before and after, a page down
mark
key 4D 01
sync 600
under end 2000
mark
text x
sync 600
under letter 2000
mark
key 28
sync 600
under commit 2000
mark
text y
key 28
sync 600
under letter2 2000
mark
key 52
sync 600
under up 2000
mark
key 51
sync 600
under down 2000
mark
key 4B
sync 600
under pageup 2000
shot big_doc_edited
# closed: saved, and the record no longer what was made
mark
key 08 01
sync 600
under closed 10000
sum
keep saved
mark
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
under reopen 10000
key 4D 01
caret
want ok c 65537,0 a 65537,0
key 08 01
sync 600
sum
same saved
absent !OACV!
